    "id": "MIR-R",
    "name": "Mirror right",
    "role": "right rear-view mirror housing on its stalk beside the cockpit",
    "notes": "Black single solid. Stalk 30x30 along +Y from local Y 385 (embedded ~10, max 15, into monocoque side wall at |Y|~395) to Y 480, centred X 0, Z 0. Housing box 40 (X) x 160 (Y) x 80 (Z) centred at (0,560,0), small edge fillets. Keep >=20 mm from halo and sidepod.",
